# AI Abandoned Cart Recovery

An AI-powered abandoned cart recovery automation built with n8n.

## What It Does

- Automatically checks abandoned cart data
- Reads customer and cart information from Google Sheets
- Identifies customers with abandoned carts
- Uses AI to generate personalized recovery emails
- Automatically sends recovery emails through Gmail

## Tools Used

- n8n
- AI / LLM
- Google Sheets
- Gmail
- Workflow Automation

## Goal

To help businesses recover potentially lost sales by automatically reaching out to customers who left items in their shopping cart, while reducing manual follow-up work.
